  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling Fund - Trial Year - Equalities Programming in Tunsia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this fund is to provide small pots of funding (&#xa3;10-30k) to UK Posts to deliver new activity around gender and equalities which aims to enable or mobilise engagement on this topic. This initiative will be an opportunity to develop our knowledge, build our relationships with key stakeholders, and enable us to better support ending gender-based violence (GBV) and discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
